# 2026-09-09, before the goodbye bow was fixed. `bow` below is the curve that
# is now called `leanBack`: the gesture named `bow` today is the version-aware
# one and moves her the other way on a 0.x body. See bow-0910.md.
vroid-sample-b        VRM 0  eyes -29.7mm so she faces -Z  | bow moves her head  -121.8mm BACKWARD (a lean away) and -26.4mm in Y
vrm1-twist-sample     VRM 1  eyes +21.4mm so she faces +Z  | bow moves her head   136.1mm FORWARD (a bow) and -8.8mm in Y
vroid-studio-dressup  VRM 1  eyes +21.4mm so she faces +Z  | bow moves her head   136.1mm FORWARD (a bow) and -8.8mm in Y
